# ==========================================
# SkillBridge Environment Configuration
# ==========================================

# 1. Frontend API URL
# - In Local Development: http://127.0.0.1:8000
# - In Vercel Production: Leave empty or omit (defaults to same-origin /api)
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# 2. Persistent Database Configuration (REQUIRED for Vercel Production)
# Vercel Serverless Functions have ephemeral filesystems. For student registrations, logins,
# and recommendations to persist permanently across browser sessions and cold starts,
# connect a persistent PostgreSQL database (e.g., Neon, Supabase, Vercel Postgres, AWS RDS):
#
# Examples:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@ep-host.region.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
# or (if using Supabase):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.xxx:password@aws-0-us-east-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?sslmode=require
# or (if using Vercel Postgres / Storage integration, Vercel auto-provides POSTGRES_URL)

# 3. Email & OTP Verification Provider (For Live Gmail Delivery)
# SkillBridge supports Resend (recommended), SendGrid, or standard SMTP (Gmail App Password, Brevo, SES):
#
# Option A - Resend (Recommended for Vercel):
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# EMAIL_FROM=SkillBridge Verification <onboarding@resend.dev>
#
# Option B - Gmail SMTP / Standard SMTP:
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASSWORD=your_16_digit_gmail_app_password
# EMAIL_FROM=SkillBridge <your_email@gmail.com>

